      "widgets_values": [
        "## Z-Image Turbo \u2014 text to image\n\nFast 8-step text-to-image (Apache 2.0). Runs in bf16 on a 24 GB GPU (RTX 3090/4090).\n\n**Models** (ComfyUI offers to download them if missing):\n- `models/diffusion_models/z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors` (12.3 GB)\n- `models/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors` (8.0 GB)\n- `models/vae/ae.safetensors` (0.3 GB)\n\nSource: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/z_image_turbo\n\n**Settings:** 8 steps, CFG 1.0 (no negative prompt needed), res_multistep / simple, shift 3.\n**Lower VRAM (16 GB):** set weight_dtype to fp8_e4m3fn.\n\n**OpenClaw / API:** prompt node `6`, seed node `3`, output node `9`."
      ],
      "title": "Read me"
    }
